{"availability":"available","full":"img2threejs/img2threejs","name":"img2threejs","description":"Rebuild the object in a reference image as a code-only, procedural, quality-gated, animation-ready Three.js model. Token-efficient image-to-3D.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":17650,"forks":1474,"created":"2026-07-15T02:58:39Z","updated":"2026-10-07T05:35:53Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://img2threejs.io","topics":["3d","ai-agents","claude-code","computer-graphics","generative","image-to-3d","procedural-generation","threejs","typescript","webgl"],"demo":"https://img2threejs.io/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T20:14:09.917Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T20:14:09.917Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T20:14:09.917Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:30.403Z","stars":17539,"forks":1465},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:14:09.917Z","stars":17650,"forks":1474}],"technologies":["Three.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Rebuild the object in a reference image as a code-only, procedural Three.js model.","Quality-gated, animation-ready, and deliberately token-efficient — reconstruction-by-code, not photogrammetry, mesh extraction, or downloaded art packs.","Reference images reconstructed in code as animation-ready Three.js models, running live in the browser."],"features":["Scripts enforce, the model judges. The Python scripts handle validation, gating, spec authoring, PBR extraction, comparison-sheet packaging, and pipeline state. They never score visuals. The model's tokens go to one…","Zero dependencies, zero install churn. Every script is pure Python 3.10+ standard library. No pip, no PIL, no numpy, no Playwright. PNG read/write is done with struct and zlib. Nothing to install means nothing to debug…","Pass-gated generation. The code generator emits only the currently unlocked build pass. The model does not regenerate or re-read the entire model on every iteration — each step is small and scoped.","Fail fast, before codegen. A strict-quality gate blocks shallow specs before a single line of Three.js is generated, so you never spend tokens rendering a model that was underspecified from the start.","One image per review. Each pass is judged from exactly one packaged comparison sheet (reference beside render), not a scattering of screenshots."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fb250c784014e273557bb82d4a3b3906ff1bb03f496e2df24b3730a7b858dd24","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T23:33:26.445Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T23:33:26.445Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Rebuild the object in a reference image as a code-only, procedural Three.js model.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"A cost ceiling — Stay at low effort and skip the presentation composer; I only need the evaluation render.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fb250c784014e273557bb82d4a3b3906ff1bb03f496e2df24b3730a7b858dd24","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T23:33:26.446Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T05:35:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T23:33:26.448Z","hash":"fb250c784014e273557bb82d4a3b3906ff1bb03f496e2df24b3730a7b858dd24","originalBytes":44023,"storedBytes":44023,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["character","img2threejs","reference","image","review","spec","code","docs","pipeline","material","every","live","object","gates","glb","one","build","install","gate","img2","model","pass","each","forge","intake","plugin","procedural","cs2","detail","grimoire","domain","only","render","see","update","add","before","own","skill","stage1","stage4"